    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Ten years ago, I thought Bol\u00edvar would find true peace if we chased the Coalition and the Singas out of the country."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "I risked my life to fight for True Bol\u00edvarians."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "In the end, three thousand of my brothers fought to their deaths. If it wasn't for my own brother risking his life to save mine, I would've been shot that day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "And that was the day when I finally realized."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "The Coalition, the Singas dynasty's nobles, and True Bol\u00edvarians. Not one of them truly wants to save Bol\u00edvar. All they are doing is fighting a war."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "And no matter how long this war lasts, Bol\u00edvar will never see salvation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "To escape the turmoil, I made my way to this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "In a hopeless country, I found this hopeless city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "And then we have Candela Sanchez, who's the most hopeless of us all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "On this hopeless swath of land, she built a city far more corrupt than all Bol\u00edvarian cities combined."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "And not only is she enjoying this herself, she is even dragging all those around her into her cesspit of enjoyment."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "All of them think they lead a proper life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "They have no idea just how much blood lies underneath them, in the city's sewers and how many scavenging beasts the place is feeding."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "She is feeding on the flesh and blood of all those who live in these lands, never to care about their lives."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "This city must die, and all of you who indulge in the pleasures this place has to offer must die with it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "The championship's over."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "Now, I will take back this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pancho",
        "text": "If no one else will save this country, I will."
    },
