    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "........"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "So your father is the one behind all this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "When you realized we were starting to piece it all together, you chose to divert our attention toward you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That way, even if we actually figured it out, you would get to buy time for the one pulling the strings."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "That's right. I'm not going to say I won, Miss Ch'en. This was never a fair fight to begin with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You came too late, and you took on Ms. Candela's mission too hastily."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "This is the final bit of generosity I have to offer, Miss Ch'en. Surrender, along with Miss Lin."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "If you give up without a fight, I can guarantee that no one will lay a finger on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You have nothing to do with this. There is no reason for you to jump into our morally gray mess."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I can't do that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "This ship has been taken over by our men. If you resist, you and Miss Lin will die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "An old friend once told me, I have to take a beating before I can learn, like a young her, that being a stubborn ass is just a stupid impulse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And even now, I've got no idea what kind of stubbornness I'm supposed to stick to and what counts as an unrealistic, stupid impulse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But my guess is she probably knows that's not enough to stop me, or my name isn't Ch'en Hui-chieh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Do what you're gonna do. I'm in a hurry."
    },
