        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Lady Candela, there are numerous unknown forces sowing chaos in the city and the surrounding countryside."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Tsk tsk... So that's your move, Pancho?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Lady Candela, please, we need to move you somewhere safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Evacuate? Don't be absurd. I have the front row seat here. I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Don't worry about the ruffians on the streets; deal with them as you see fit. My guess is that I am their ultimate objective anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Oh, don't forget to clear the crowds too. Be sure to close the city's gates first, though. Send everyone home."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "After that, secure the staff."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "However."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Make sure they make preparations for the banquet, and definitely make sure the championship's live broadcast goes uninterrupted."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Protect them, but don't ruin my championship. Is that understood?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Roger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_207",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Candela",
        "text": "Right, and get me some new drones. They probably wrecked all the ones on the ship. We mustn't miss out on all this fun."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
