            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Hey, you're kidding. We're here on holiday. How did this happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Though I guess this is what Bol\u00edvar is supposed to feel like."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Enough. Let's figure out what to do with this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Missy, we're tourists. This is nothing we should poke our heads into."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Would you say that to Ch'en Hui-chieh if she was standing right here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Of course, but I'm sure you know what she'd say."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Then my answer's the same."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Alright. All I'll say is I'm not against this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Rhodes Island... Ugh, Sideroca's getting drinks. Let me go check on her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "And, besides, the two of them are on the ship too. How am I not supposed to worry?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "I'm not all that worried about them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What's more, we are outsiders. It's not like we've got a side here. Though with all this ruckus going on, I very much doubt Ch'en and Lin are oblivious."
